{const c={"id":"drilling-rop-v22","sceneId":"d1","title":"钻速预测与参数优化：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"钻压是钻头施加在岩石上的轴向力，转速决定切削频率，机械钻速表示单位时间钻进的长度。增大钻压并不保证持续增速，还可能提高扭矩与振动。","judge":[{"label":"智能方法","value":"岭回归 + 受约束网格搜索","desc":"原生 JavaScript 实际计算"},{"label":"数据来源","value":"教学合成","desc":"训练与测试独立随机种子"},{"label":"评估","value":"钻速 MAE / m·h⁻¹","desc":"同一测试序列与基线比较"},{"label":"边界","value":"演示","desc":"演示扭矩约束是人为设定的简化模型；未考虑井壁稳定、井漏或钻头磨损。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与业务问题","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 740 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"钻速预测与参数优化概念示意\"><rect width=\"740\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><g fill=\"#345648\" font-size=\"17\"><path d=\"M130 20V85M100 65L130 95L160 65\" stroke=\"#c38d42\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"100\" y=\"98\" width=\"60\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#3f7d64\"/><path d=\"M20 140H300M20 155H300\" stroke=\"#bba780\" stroke-width=\"10\"/><text x=\"335\" y=\"60\">钻压 ↓ 让钻头接触与破碎岩石</text><text x=\"335\" y=\"100\">转速 ↻ 影响切削频率</text><text x=\"335\" y=\"140\">钻速增益需受扭矩等约束</text></g></svg><p>概念示意，非工程结构图，不按比例绘制。</p><p>钻压是钻头施加在岩石上的轴向力，转速决定切削频率，机械钻速表示单位时间钻进的长度。增大钻压并不保证持续增速，还可能提高扭矩与振动。</p><p>凭经验调参难以同时考虑地层变化、效率和载荷约束。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"LEARNING","title":"智能化介入点","html":"<p>方法：岭回归 + 受约束网格搜索。输入：钻压、转速、岩性代理特征及钻速标签。输出：每段机械钻速与约束内的候选钻压。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>01 按井划分数据</b><p>输入：工况序列 → 输出：无泄漏样本</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>02 拟合钻速代理模型</b><p>输入：特征 → 输出：回归系数</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>03 筛选候选参数</b><p>候选参数 → 可行域 → 预测钻速排序</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>04 比较与复核</b><p>误差曲线 + 约束检查 → 人工审核</p></div></div><p>回归案例从 400 条训练样本拟合系数，预警案例从 400 条正常样本学习均值与标准差；测试真值仅用于评价，不进入预测函数。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据条件与验证","html":"<p>现场需要：钻压、转速、岩性代理特征及钻速标签；先从少量井建立概念验证，再按独立井、钻具或连续时间块留出验收，不能随机混合相邻采样点。</p><p>演示训练种子固定 17，正常基线种子 27，测试种子初始 91。第二滑块调节观测噪声或状态扰动；更换样本会更换测试种子，训练模型保持固定。</p><p>所用归一化输入在 0–1 范围内，演示的参数区间与数据规模不是现场推荐标准。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"适用边界与参考","html":"<p>演示扭矩约束是人为设定的简化模型；未考虑井壁稳定、井漏或钻头磨损。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-directional-drilling\">SLB：定向钻井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-drilling-fluids\">SLB：钻井液概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">官方线性模型原理</a>。这些资料用于概念与方法参考；本项目合成公式与演示代码为独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"钻速预测与参数优化的四步实验","lead":["每一步的输入输出见下图。进入案例演示，可调节参数并导出实际计算结果。"],"stats":[["训练样本","400"],["计算","浏览器"],["验证","独立测试"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 · 按井划分数据","role":"数据","do":"将钻压、转速和地层标记按时间对齐，并按井留出验证。","effect":"输入：工况序列 → 输出：无泄漏样本","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"02 · 拟合钻速代理模型","role":"学习","do":"学习钻压平方和钻压×转速等特征到钻速的映射。","effect":"输入：特征 → 输出：回归系数","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"03 · 筛选候选参数","role":"决策","do":"扫描 40–180 kN 钻压，剔除预测扭矩超过 16 kN·m 的候选。","effect":"候选参数 → 可行域 → 预测钻速排序","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"04 · 比较与复核","role":"验收","do":"同时查看测试钻速误差与推荐点扭矩，识别外推风险。","effect":"误差曲线 + 约束检查 → 人工审核","trap":"演示扭矩约束是人为设定的简化模型；未考虑井壁稳定、井漏或钻头磨损。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与验收口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>01 按井划分数据</b><p>输入：工况序列 → 输出：无泄漏样本</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>02 拟合钻速代理模型</b><p>输入：特征 → 输出：回归系数</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>03 筛选候选参数</b><p>候选参数 → 可行域 → 预测钻速排序</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>04 比较与复核</b><p>误差曲线 + 约束检查 → 人工审核</p></div></div><p>指标：钻速 MAE / m·h⁻¹。MAE = 平均绝对误差；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。轨迹误差按横向位移比较；疲劳误差是归一化损伤，不是寿命误差。所有基线与学习模型使用同一测试序列。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"数据泄漏","why":"相邻采样混入训练和测试会虚高结果，现场需要按井或时间块隔离。"},{"name":"工况迁移","why":"岩性、设备、钻井液配方或控制响应变化后必须重新验证。"},{"name":"模型范围","why":"演示扭矩约束是人为设定的简化模型；未考虑井壁稳定、井漏或钻头磨损。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2823,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>钻速预测与参数优化</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>钻速预测与参数优化</h1><p class=\"lead\">钻压是钻头施加在岩石上的轴向力，转速决定切削频率，机械钻速表示单位时间钻进的长度。增大钻压并不保证持续增速，还可能提高扭矩与振动。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>钻压 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"钻压\" type=\"range\" min=\"40\" max=\"180\" value=\"100\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 扰动 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：设计/真值；绿：学习/受控；灰：传统基线；各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>同一井段：真值、预测与固定基线</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"同一井段：真值、预测与固定基线\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>候选钻压搜索：浅红区域超出教学扭矩约束</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"候选钻压搜索：浅红区域超出教学扭矩约束\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>岭回归 + 受约束网格搜索；400条独立训练样本，换井不改变训练参数。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">演示扭矩约束是人为设定的简化模型；未考虑井壁稳定、井漏或钻头磨损。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13261,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"rop\",SPEC={\"unit\":\" kN\",\"value\":100,\"inspect\":\"横轴为测试井段序号。钻速单位 m/h，误差按同一井段配对；右图候选钻压的推荐只受教学扭矩模型约束，不是现场参数指令。\"};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x));\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nlet seed=91,rows=[],header=[],frame=0;\nconst training=(()=>{let r=rng(17),data=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let a=r(),b=r(),c=r();let x,y;if(TYPE==='rop'){x=[1,a,b,c,a*b,a*a];y=8+30*a+20*b-12*c+8*a*b-13*a*a}else if(TYPE==='trajectory'){x=[1,a*2-1];y=.7*x[1]+.04}else if(TYPE==='fatigue'){x=[1,a,b,a*a];y=.002+.009*a+.003*b+.012*a*a}else {x=[1,a,b,c];y=24+20*a-9*b+12*c}data.push({x,y:y+(r()-.5)*(TYPE==='trajectory'?.03:TYPE==='fatigue'?.001:1)})}return fit(data)})();\nlet rnormal=rng(27),normal=Array.from({length:400},()=>[rnormal(),rnormal(),rnormal()]);\nconst mean=[0,1,2].map(j=>normal.reduce((s,x)=>s+x[j],0)/normal.length),sd=[0,1,2].map(j=>Math.sqrt(normal.reduce((s,x)=>s+(x[j]-mean[j])**2,0)/normal.length));\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max<1?2:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>`<div><span>${a}</span><strong>${b}</strong></div>`).join('')}\nfunction run(){let param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;rows=[];\n if(TYPE==='rop'){let a=param/180,b=.55,c=.25+(seed%17)/50,truth=[],pred=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<90;i++){let rock=clamp(c+.3*Math.sin(i/15),0,1),actual=8+30*a+20*b-12*rock+8*a*b-13*a*a;truth.push(actual);pred.push(predict(training,[1,a,b,clamp(rock+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),a*b,a*a]));base.push(30)}let best={score:-1};let landscape=[];for(let wob=40;wob<=180;wob+=2){let aw=wob/180,rate=predict(training,[1,aw,b,c,aw*b,aw*aw]),torque=4+.065*wob+.02*120,safe=torque<=16;landscape.push(rate);if(safe&&rate>best.score)best={score:rate,wob,torque}}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'}],0,65,'测试井段序号','机械钻速 / m·h⁻¹');chart('b',[{values:landscape,color:'#267e65'}],0,65,'候选序号（钻压 40 + 序号 × 2 kN）','预测钻速 / m·h⁻¹',[{start:54,end:70,color:'#fae7df'}]);metrics([['学习 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(2)+' m/h'],['固定基线 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(2)+' m/h'],['受约束推荐钻压',best.wob+' kN'],['推荐点预测扭矩',best.torque.toFixed(2)+' kN·m']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归学习钻压、转速、岩性与钻速的非线性特征映射。当前钻压影响左图；右图遍历候选钻压，按演示扭矩模型排除超过 16 kN·m 的点后选取最高预测钻速。转速固定 120 rpm。左图橙：真值；绿：学习；灰：固定 30 m/h。';header=['segment','truth_m_h','prediction_m_h','baseline_m_h'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='warning'){let scores=[],truth=[],pred=[],base=[],flow=[];for(let t=0;t<120;t++){let event=t>=65&&t<100,level=event?(t-65)/35:0,x=[r(),r(),r()];x[0]+=.8*level;x[1]-=.9*level;x[2]+=.7*level;x=x.map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*noise);let z=x.map((v,j)=>(v-mean[j])/sd[j]),s=Math.sqrt(z.reduce((sum,v)=>sum+v*v,0)/3);scores.push(s);truth.push(event?1:0);pred.push(s>param/10?1:0);base.push(x[0]>1.25?1:0);flow.push(x[1])}let counts=a=>{let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),fp,fn}};let out=counts(pred);chart('a',[{values:scores,color:'#267e65'},{values:scores.map(()=>param/10),color:'#c78c3c'}],0,4,'采样时刻 / min','标准化多变量异常分数',[{start:65,end:99,color:'#faebd4'}]);chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred.map(v=>v*.8),color:'#267e65'},{values:base.map(v=>v*.6),color:'#8c9690'}],0,1.2,'采样时刻 / min','事件与报警（分层显示）');metrics([['多变量 F1',(out.f*100).toFixed(1)+'%'],['单通道基线 F1',(counts(base).f*100).toFixed(1)+'%'],['误报 / 漏报',out.fp+' / '+out.fn],['阈值',(param/10).toFixed(1)]]);$('explain').textContent='400 条正常样本学习各通道均值与标准差，综合扭矩、返出流量、立压的标准化偏离。浅橙区为合成前兆区间，不是已确认事故。阈值降低会提高敏感度，也可能增加误报。右图橙为真值（1），绿为多变量报警（0.8），灰为单通道基线（0.6）。分数不是事故概率。';header=['minute','anomaly_score','truth','alarm','single_channel_alarm'];rows=scores.map((v,i)=>[i,v,truth[i],pred[i],base[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='trajectory'){let target=Array.from({length:61},(_,i)=>param*Math.sin(i/60*Math.PI/2)),actual=[0],baseline=[0],actions=[];for(let i=0;i<60;i++){let best={loss:Infinity,u:0};for(let u=-1;u<=1.001;u+=.05){let next=actual[i]+predict(training,[1,u]);let loss=(next-target[i+1])**2+.15*u*u;if(loss<best.loss)best={loss,u}}actions.push(best.u);let disturb=(r()-.5)*noise*.5;actual.push(actual[i]+.7*best.u+.04+disturb);baseline.push(baseline[i]+.04+disturb)}chart('a',[{values:target,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:actual,color:'#267e65'},{values:baseline,color:'#8c9690'}],-5,35,'进尺步（每步 10 m）','二维示意横向位移 / m');chart('b',[{values:actions,color:'#267e65'}],-1.2,1.2,'控制步（每步 10 m）','归一化纠偏动作 u');metrics([['闭环轨迹 MAE',mae(actual,target).toFixed(2)+' m'],['不纠偏基线 MAE',mae(baseline,target).toFixed(2)+' m'],['学得动作增益',training[1].toFixed(3)],['终点偏差',Math.abs(actual[60]-target[60]).toFixed(2)+' m']]);$('explain').textContent='400 条动作—位移样本辨识响应增益。每推进一步，用学习模型预测各候选动作的下一步位移，最小化偏差平方与动作惩罚，再在独立扰动下模拟执行。橙：设计；绿：闭环；灰：不纠偏。这是一维横向状态的教学控制器，不是完整三维井眼或工具面模型。';header=['step_10m','target_m','controlled_m','baseline_m','action'];rows=target.map((v,i)=>[i,v,actual[i],baseline[i],actions[i]??'']);}\n if(TYPE==='fatigue'){let a=param/100,b=.45,D=0,P=0,B=0,truth=[],pred=[],base=[],rul=[];for(let t=0;t<90;t++){let v=clamp(a+.12*Math.sin((t+seed%31)/10),0,1),damage=.002+.009*v+.003*b+.012*v*v,observed=clamp(v+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),est=Math.max(.0001,predict(training,[1,observed,b,observed*observed]));D+=damage;P+=est;B+=.012;truth.push(D);pred.push(P);base.push(B);rul.push(Math.max(0,(1-P)/est))}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'},{values:truth.map(()=>1),color:'#bb5d52'}],0,2.5,'服役时间 / h','归一化累积损伤 D');chart('b',[{values:rul,color:'#267e65'}],0,500,'服役时间 / h','按当前损伤率外推 RUL / h');metrics([['损伤预测 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(3)],['固定损伤率 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(3)],['末时刻预测损伤',P.toFixed(3)],['末时刻外推寿命',rul.at(-1).toFixed(1)+' h']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归学习振动与扭矩特征到单位时间损伤增量的映射，再逐小时累加；RUL = max(0,(1-D)/当前损伤率)。橙：合成真值；绿：预测；灰：固定损伤率；红：教学失效阈值 D=1。真实疲劳需要载荷谱、材料 S-N 曲线与探伤验证，不能把示意 RUL 当作起钻依据。';header=['hour','damage_truth','damage_predicted','fixed_rate_damage','rul_h'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],rul[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='mud'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],doses=[];for(let t=0;t<90;t++){let a=.4+.2*Math.sin((t+seed%31)/14),temp=.35+.25*t/90,c=param/100,y=24+20*a-9*temp+12*c,p=predict(training,[1,clamp(a+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),temp,c]);truth.push(y);pred.push(p);base.push(35);let dose=0,loss=Infinity;for(let d=-1;d<=1.001;d+=.02){let after=p+8*d,val=(after-38)**2+2*d*d;if(val<loss){loss=val;dose=d}}doses.push(dose)}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'},{values:truth.map(()=>38),color:'#ab6654'}],15,60,'循环采样时刻（每步 5 min）','塑性黏度 PV / mPa·s');chart('b',[{values:doses,color:'#267e65'}],-1.2,1.2,'循环采样时刻（每步 5 min）','归一化处理建议（负值为减黏方向）');metrics([['软测量 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(2)+' mPa·s'],['固定基线 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(2)+' mPa·s'],['目标塑性黏度','38 mPa·s'],['末点处理方向',doses.at(-1)>0?'增黏':'减黏']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归从循环压力代理特征、归一化温度、含砂特征估算塑性黏度，再搜索处理方向以接近目标并惩罚过大调整。橙：真值；绿：估计；灰：固定 35；红：目标 38。动作图是无量纲建议，没有换算现场药剂剂量；未模拟处理后的闭环效果。';header=['sample_5min','pv_truth_mPas','pv_predicted_mPas','baseline_mPas','normalized_action'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],doses[i]]);}\n $('details').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr>'+header.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr></thead><tbody>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>';\n}\nfunction labels(){$('pv').value=$('param').value+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2)}\nfunction schedule(){labels();if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}\nfor(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}\n$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let b=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+header.join(',')+'\\n'+rows.map(r=>r.join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(b),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='drilling-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=25;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='warning'?'正常参考均值：'+mean.map(v=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' / ')+'；标准差：'+sd.map(v=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' / '):'实际学习系数：'+training.map(v=>v.toFixed(5)).join(' / ')};\nfunction inspect(){selected=clamp(selected,0,rows.length-1);$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=header.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let warning=TYPE==='warning',a=rows.map(r=>warning?+(r[2]!==r[3]):r[2]-r[1]),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs));$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+(warning?'逐时刻报警错误（1 为判错）':'学习结果 − 合成真值（正负偏差）')+'；幅度上限 '+max.toFixed(3)+'</text><path d=\"M35 80H685\" stroke=\"#d8d4ca\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?80-v/max*50:80)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-1)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.4,Math.abs(v)/max*50)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#b26a39':'#41699b')+'\"/>').join('')+'<text x=\"35\" y=\"155\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"10\">与主图相同的采样序号 →；柱形数值来自本次计算结果</text>';}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(clamp((x-55)/560,0,1)*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=25;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"drilling-warning-v22","sceneId":"d2","title":"井下复杂事故前兆预警：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"扭矩、立管压力和返出流量共同反映井下状态。例如返出流量偏离正常循环规律，可能提示需要复核的工况变化；单一通道异常不能直接判定事故类型。","judge":[{"label":"智能方法","value":"正常工况统计学习 + 多变量异常检测","desc":"原生 JavaScript 实际计算"},{"label":"数据来源","value":"教学合成","desc":"训练与测试独立随机种子"},{"label":"评估","value":"F1、误报数、漏报数","desc":"同一测试序列与基线比较"},{"label":"边界","value":"演示","desc":"只检测偏离，不识别卡钻、井漏或气侵的具体类型；分数不是事故概率。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与业务问题","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 740 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"井下复杂事故前兆预警概念示意\"><rect width=\"740\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><g fill=\"#345648\" font-size=\"17\"><path d=\"M20 50H190L250 28H310M20 90H190L250 120H310M20 140H190L250 110H310\" stroke=\"#3f7d64\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"50\">扭矩 ↑</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"95\">返出流量 ↓</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"140\">多通道偏离 → 待复核异常</text></g></svg><p>概念示意，非工程结构图，不按比例绘制。</p><p>扭矩、立管压力和返出流量共同反映井下状态。例如返出流量偏离正常循环规律，可能提示需要复核的工况变化；单一通道异常不能直接判定事故类型。</p><p>固定单通道阈值容易漏掉多通道轻微但一致的偏移，也会受到工况切换干扰。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"LEARNING","title":"智能化介入点","html":"<p>方法：正常工况统计学习 + 多变量异常检测。输入：正常段多通道特征；验收时独立提供前兆区间。输出：异常分数与超过阈值的报警时刻。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>01 划定正常工况</b><p>工况划分 → 正常参考集</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>02 学习正常分布</b><p>各通道 → z 分数</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>03 融合与报警</b><p>多通道偏离 → 综合分数 → 报警</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>04 事件级复核</b><p>报警时序 + 事件标签 → 验收</p></div></div><p>回归案例从 400 条训练样本拟合系数，预警案例从 400 条正常样本学习均值与标准差；测试真值仅用于评价，不进入预测函数。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据条件与验证","html":"<p>现场需要：正常段多通道特征；验收时独立提供前兆区间；先从少量井建立概念验证，再按独立井、钻具或连续时间块留出验收，不能随机混合相邻采样点。</p><p>演示训练种子固定 17，正常基线种子 27，测试种子初始 91。第二滑块调节观测噪声或状态扰动；更换样本会更换测试种子，训练模型保持固定。</p><p>所用归一化输入在 0–1 范围内，演示的参数区间与数据规模不是现场推荐标准。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"适用边界与参考","html":"<p>只检测偏离，不识别卡钻、井漏或气侵的具体类型；分数不是事故概率。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-directional-drilling\">SLB：定向钻井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-drilling-fluids\">SLB：钻井液概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">官方线性模型原理</a>。这些资料用于概念与方法参考；本项目合成公式与演示代码为独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"井下复杂事故前兆预警的四步实验","lead":["每一步的输入输出见下图。进入案例演示，可调节参数并导出实际计算结果。"],"stats":[["训练样本","400"],["计算","浏览器"],["验证","独立测试"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 · 划定正常工况","role":"数据","do":"先区分钻进、接单根和起下钻，只用同类正常样本学习。","effect":"工况划分 → 正常参考集","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"02 · 学习正常分布","role":"学习","do":"计算各通道的均值和标准差，将量纲不同的信号标准化。","effect":"各通道 → z 分数","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"03 · 融合与报警","role":"决策","do":"计算三个标准化偏离平方均值的平方根，超过可调阈值报警。","effect":"多通道偏离 → 综合分数 → 报警","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"04 · 逐时刻复核","role":"验收","do":"对照合成前兆窗口，逐时刻统计误报、漏报和 F1。本例未计算事件级提前量，不将采样点 F1 当作事故级检出率。","effect":"报警时序 + 事件标签 → 验收","trap":"只检测偏离，不识别卡钻、井漏或气侵的具体类型；分数不是事故概率。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与验收口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>01 划定正常工况</b><p>工况划分 → 正常参考集</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>02 学习正常分布</b><p>各通道 → z 分数</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>03 融合与报警</b><p>多通道偏离 → 综合分数 → 报警</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>04 事件级复核</b><p>报警时序 + 事件标签 → 验收</p></div></div><p>指标：F1、误报数、漏报数。MAE = 平均绝对误差；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。轨迹误差按横向位移比较；疲劳误差是归一化损伤，不是寿命误差。所有基线与学习模型使用同一测试序列。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"数据泄漏","why":"相邻采样混入训练和测试会虚高结果，现场需要按井或时间块隔离。"},{"name":"工况迁移","why":"岩性、设备、钻井液配方或控制响应变化后必须重新验证。"},{"name":"模型范围","why":"只检测偏离，不识别卡钻、井漏或气侵的具体类型；分数不是事故概率。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2890,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>井下复杂事故前兆预警</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>井下复杂事故前兆预警</h1><p class=\"lead\">扭矩、立管压力和返出流量共同反映井下状态。例如返出流量偏离正常循环规律，可能提示需要复核的工况变化；单一通道异常不能直接判定事故类型。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>异常阈值 ×10 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"异常阈值 ×10\" type=\"range\" min=\"5\" max=\"30\" value=\"16\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 扰动 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：设计/真值；绿：学习/受控；灰：传统基线；各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>综合偏离分数与报警阈值（浅橙：前兆标签）</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"综合偏离分数与报警阈值（浅橙：前兆标签）\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>真值、多变量报警、单通道报警分层显示</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"真值、多变量报警、单通道报警分层显示\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>正常工况统计学习 + 多变量异常检测；400条独立训练样本，换井不改变训练参数。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">只检测偏离，不识别卡钻、井漏或气侵的具体类型；分数不是事故概率。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13241,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"warning\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":16,\"inspect\":\"每行是一个分钟采样点；标签和报警为 0/1。分数依据正常参考标准化，标签只做验收。逐点 F1 不是事件级事故检出率，也不是事故概率。\"};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x));\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nlet seed=91,rows=[],header=[],frame=0;\nconst training=(()=>{let r=rng(17),data=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let a=r(),b=r(),c=r();let x,y;if(TYPE==='rop'){x=[1,a,b,c,a*b,a*a];y=8+30*a+20*b-12*c+8*a*b-13*a*a}else if(TYPE==='trajectory'){x=[1,a*2-1];y=.7*x[1]+.04}else if(TYPE==='fatigue'){x=[1,a,b,a*a];y=.002+.009*a+.003*b+.012*a*a}else {x=[1,a,b,c];y=24+20*a-9*b+12*c}data.push({x,y:y+(r()-.5)*(TYPE==='trajectory'?.03:TYPE==='fatigue'?.001:1)})}return fit(data)})();\nlet rnormal=rng(27),normal=Array.from({length:400},()=>[rnormal(),rnormal(),rnormal()]);\nconst mean=[0,1,2].map(j=>normal.reduce((s,x)=>s+x[j],0)/normal.length),sd=[0,1,2].map(j=>Math.sqrt(normal.reduce((s,x)=>s+(x[j]-mean[j])**2,0)/normal.length));\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max<1?2:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>`<div><span>${a}</span><strong>${b}</strong></div>`).join('')}\nfunction run(){let param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;rows=[];\n if(TYPE==='rop'){let a=param/180,b=.55,c=.25+(seed%17)/50,truth=[],pred=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<90;i++){let rock=clamp(c+.3*Math.sin(i/15),0,1),actual=8+30*a+20*b-12*rock+8*a*b-13*a*a;truth.push(actual);pred.push(predict(training,[1,a,b,clamp(rock+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),a*b,a*a]));base.push(30)}let best={score:-1};let landscape=[];for(let wob=40;wob<=180;wob+=2){let aw=wob/180,rate=predict(training,[1,aw,b,c,aw*b,aw*aw]),torque=4+.065*wob+.02*120,safe=torque<=16;landscape.push(rate);if(safe&&rate>best.score)best={score:rate,wob,torque}}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'}],0,65,'测试井段序号','机械钻速 / m·h⁻¹');chart('b',[{values:landscape,color:'#267e65'}],0,65,'候选序号（钻压 40 + 序号 × 2 kN）','预测钻速 / m·h⁻¹');metrics([['学习 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(2)+' m/h'],['固定基线 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(2)+' m/h'],['受约束推荐钻压',best.wob+' kN'],['推荐点预测扭矩',best.torque.toFixed(2)+' kN·m']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归学习钻压、转速、岩性与钻速的非线性特征映射。当前钻压影响左图；右图遍历候选钻压，按演示扭矩模型排除超过 16 kN·m 的点后选取最高预测钻速。转速固定 120 rpm。左图橙：真值；绿：学习；灰：固定 30 m/h。';header=['segment','truth_m_h','prediction_m_h','baseline_m_h'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='warning'){let scores=[],truth=[],pred=[],base=[],flow=[];for(let t=0;t<120;t++){let event=t>=65&&t<100,level=event?(t-65)/35:0,x=[r(),r(),r()];x[0]+=.8*level;x[1]-=.9*level;x[2]+=.7*level;x=x.map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*noise);let z=x.map((v,j)=>(v-mean[j])/sd[j]),s=Math.sqrt(z.reduce((sum,v)=>sum+v*v,0)/3);scores.push(s);truth.push(event?1:0);pred.push(s>param/10?1:0);base.push(x[0]>1.25?1:0);flow.push(x[1])}let counts=a=>{let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),fp,fn}};let out=counts(pred);chart('a',[{values:scores,color:'#267e65'},{values:scores.map(()=>param/10),color:'#c78c3c'}],0,4,'采样时刻 / min','标准化多变量异常分数',[{start:65,end:99,color:'#faebd4'}]);chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred.map(v=>v*.8),color:'#267e65'},{values:base.map(v=>v*.6),color:'#8c9690'}],0,1.2,'采样时刻 / min','事件与报警（分层显示）');metrics([['多变量 F1',(out.f*100).toFixed(1)+'%'],['单通道基线 F1',(counts(base).f*100).toFixed(1)+'%'],['误报 / 漏报',out.fp+' / '+out.fn],['阈值',(param/10).toFixed(1)]]);$('explain').textContent='400 条正常样本学习各通道均值与标准差，综合扭矩、返出流量、立压的标准化偏离。浅橙区为合成前兆区间，不是已确认事故。阈值降低会提高敏感度，也可能增加误报。右图橙为真值（1），绿为多变量报警（0.8），灰为单通道基线（0.6）。分数不是事故概率。';header=['minute','anomaly_score','truth','alarm','single_channel_alarm'];rows=scores.map((v,i)=>[i,v,truth[i],pred[i],base[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='trajectory'){let target=Array.from({length:61},(_,i)=>param*Math.sin(i/60*Math.PI/2)),actual=[0],baseline=[0],actions=[];for(let i=0;i<60;i++){let best={loss:Infinity,u:0};for(let u=-1;u<=1.001;u+=.05){let next=actual[i]+predict(training,[1,u]);let loss=(next-target[i+1])**2+.15*u*u;if(loss<best.loss)best={loss,u}}actions.push(best.u);let disturb=(r()-.5)*noise*.5;actual.push(actual[i]+.7*best.u+.04+disturb);baseline.push(baseline[i]+.04+disturb)}chart('a',[{values:target,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:actual,color:'#267e65'},{values:baseline,color:'#8c9690'}],-5,35,'进尺步（每步 10 m）','二维示意横向位移 / m');chart('b',[{values:actions,color:'#267e65'}],-1.2,1.2,'控制步（每步 10 m）','归一化纠偏动作 u');metrics([['闭环轨迹 MAE',mae(actual,target).toFixed(2)+' m'],['不纠偏基线 MAE',mae(baseline,target).toFixed(2)+' m'],['学得动作增益',training[1].toFixed(3)],['终点偏差',Math.abs(actual[60]-target[60]).toFixed(2)+' m']]);$('explain').textContent='400 条动作—位移样本辨识响应增益。每推进一步，用学习模型预测各候选动作的下一步位移，最小化偏差平方与动作惩罚，再在独立扰动下模拟执行。橙：设计；绿：闭环；灰：不纠偏。这是一维横向状态的教学控制器，不是完整三维井眼或工具面模型。';header=['step_10m','target_m','controlled_m','baseline_m','action'];rows=target.map((v,i)=>[i,v,actual[i],baseline[i],actions[i]??'']);}\n if(TYPE==='fatigue'){let a=param/100,b=.45,D=0,P=0,B=0,truth=[],pred=[],base=[],rul=[];for(let t=0;t<90;t++){let v=clamp(a+.12*Math.sin((t+seed%31)/10),0,1),damage=.002+.009*v+.003*b+.012*v*v,observed=clamp(v+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),est=Math.max(.0001,predict(training,[1,observed,b,observed*observed]));D+=damage;P+=est;B+=.012;truth.push(D);pred.push(P);base.push(B);rul.push(Math.max(0,(1-P)/est))}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'},{values:truth.map(()=>1),color:'#bb5d52'}],0,2.5,'服役时间 / h','归一化累积损伤 D');chart('b',[{values:rul,color:'#267e65'}],0,500,'服役时间 / h','按当前损伤率外推 RUL / h');metrics([['损伤预测 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(3)],['固定损伤率 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(3)],['末时刻预测损伤',P.toFixed(3)],['末时刻外推寿命',rul.at(-1).toFixed(1)+' h']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归学习振动与扭矩特征到单位时间损伤增量的映射，再逐小时累加；RUL = max(0,(1-D)/当前损伤率)。橙：合成真值；绿：预测；灰：固定损伤率；红：教学失效阈值 D=1。真实疲劳需要载荷谱、材料 S-N 曲线与探伤验证，不能把示意 RUL 当作起钻依据。';header=['hour','damage_truth','damage_predicted','fixed_rate_damage','rul_h'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],rul[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='mud'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],doses=[];for(let t=0;t<90;t++){let a=.4+.2*Math.sin((t+seed%31)/14),temp=.35+.25*t/90,c=param/100,y=24+20*a-9*temp+12*c,p=predict(training,[1,clamp(a+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),temp,c]);truth.push(y);pred.push(p);base.push(35);let dose=0,loss=Infinity;for(let d=-1;d<=1.001;d+=.02){let after=p+8*d,val=(after-38)**2+2*d*d;if(val<loss){loss=val;dose=d}}doses.push(dose)}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'},{values:truth.map(()=>38),color:'#ab6654'}],15,60,'循环采样时刻（每步 5 min）','塑性黏度 PV / mPa·s');chart('b',[{values:doses,color:'#267e65'}],-1.2,1.2,'循环采样时刻（每步 5 min）','归一化处理建议（负值为减黏方向）');metrics([['软测量 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(2)+' mPa·s'],['固定基线 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(2)+' mPa·s'],['目标塑性黏度','38 mPa·s'],['末点处理方向',doses.at(-1)>0?'增黏':'减黏']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归从循环压力代理特征、归一化温度、含砂特征估算塑性黏度，再搜索处理方向以接近目标并惩罚过大调整。橙：真值；绿：估计；灰：固定 35；红：目标 38。动作图是无量纲建议，没有换算现场药剂剂量；未模拟处理后的闭环效果。';header=['sample_5min','pv_truth_mPas','pv_predicted_mPas','baseline_mPas','normalized_action'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],doses[i]]);}\n $('details').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr>'+header.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr></thead><tbody>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>';\n}\nfunction labels(){$('pv').value=$('param').value+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2)}\nfunction schedule(){labels();if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}\nfor(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}\n$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let b=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+header.join(',')+'\\n'+rows.map(r=>r.join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(b),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='drilling-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=25;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='warning'?'正常参考均值：'+mean.map(v=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' / ')+'；标准差：'+sd.map(v=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' / '):'实际学习系数：'+training.map(v=>v.toFixed(5)).join(' / ')};\nfunction inspect(){selected=clamp(selected,0,rows.length-1);$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=header.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let warning=TYPE==='warning',a=rows.map(r=>warning?+(r[2]!==r[3]):r[2]-r[1]),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs));$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+(warning?'逐时刻报警错误（1 为判错）':'学习结果 − 合成真值（正负偏差）')+'；幅度上限 '+max.toFixed(3)+'</text><path d=\"M35 80H685\" stroke=\"#d8d4ca\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?80-v/max*50:80)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-1)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.4,Math.abs(v)/max*50)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#b26a39':'#41699b')+'\"/>').join('')+'<text x=\"35\" y=\"155\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"10\">与主图相同的采样序号 →；柱形数值来自本次计算结果</text>';}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(clamp((x-55)/560,0,1)*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=25;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"drilling-trajectory-v22","sceneId":"d3","title":"井眼轨迹智能控制：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"定向钻井通过调整工具响应，使井眼接近目标轨迹。实际轨迹涉及井斜、方位、测深与狗腿度；本例把它简化为沿进尺推进的横向位移，解释预测控制的基本思想。","judge":[{"label":"智能方法","value":"线性系统辨识 + 一步预测控制","desc":"原生 JavaScript 实际计算"},{"label":"数据来源","value":"教学合成","desc":"训练与测试独立随机种子"},{"label":"评估","value":"横向位移 MAE / m","desc":"同一测试序列与基线比较"},{"label":"边界","value":"演示","desc":"只模拟一维横向状态，不是三维轨迹控制；无真实工具面或狗腿约束，不能用于现场。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与业务问题","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 740 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"井眼轨迹智能控制概念示意\"><rect width=\"740\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><g fill=\"#345648\" font-size=\"17\"><path d=\"M30 25Q250 25 270 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c38d42\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M30 32Q220 40 250 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3f7d64\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"55\">橙色：设计轨迹（示意）</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"100\">绿色：受扰动的实钻轨迹</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"145\">测量 → 预测 → 纠偏 → 再测量</text></g></svg><p>概念示意，非工程结构图，不按比例绘制。</p><p>定向钻井通过调整工具响应，使井眼接近目标轨迹。实际轨迹涉及井斜、方位、测深与狗腿度；本例把它简化为沿进尺推进的横向位移，解释预测控制的基本思想。</p><p>手动纠偏容易滞后；控制量过大又会造成频繁转向和轨迹波动。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"LEARNING","title":"智能化介入点","html":"<p>方法：线性系统辨识 + 一步预测控制。输入：归一化纠偏动作与相邻测点位移增量。输出：每一步控制建议、轨迹偏差与动作序列。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>01 构造动作响应样本</b><p>动作 u → 位移增量 Δx</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>02 辨识响应增益</b><p>成对数据 → 增益 g 与偏置 b</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>03 逐步预测并决策</b><p>当前状态 + 目标 → 候选预测 → 最优动作</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>04 模拟执行与再规划</b><p>执行 → 新状态 → 下一次预测</p></div></div><p>回归案例从 400 条训练样本拟合系数，预警案例从 400 条正常样本学习均值与标准差；测试真值仅用于评价，不进入预测函数。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据条件与验证","html":"<p>现场需要：归一化纠偏动作与相邻测点位移增量；先从少量井建立概念验证，再按独立井、钻具或连续时间块留出验收，不能随机混合相邻采样点。</p><p>演示训练种子固定 17，正常基线种子 27，测试种子初始 91。第二滑块调节观测噪声或状态扰动；更换样本会更换测试种子，训练模型保持固定。</p><p>所用归一化输入在 0–1 范围内，演示的参数区间与数据规模不是现场推荐标准。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"适用边界与参考","html":"<p>只模拟一维横向状态，不是三维轨迹控制；无真实工具面或狗腿约束，不能用于现场。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-directional-drilling\">SLB：定向钻井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-drilling-fluids\">SLB：钻井液概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">官方线性模型原理</a>。这些资料用于概念与方法参考；本项目合成公式与演示代码为独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"井眼轨迹智能控制的四步实验","lead":["每一步的输入输出见下图。进入案例演示，可调节参数并导出实际计算结果。"],"stats":[["训练样本","400"],["计算","浏览器"],["验证","独立测试"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 · 构造动作响应样本","role":"数据","do":"将历史纠偏动作与下一测点横向位移增量配对。","effect":"动作 u → 位移增量 Δx","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"02 · 辨识响应增益","role":"学习","do":"拟合 Δx = b + g·u，得到工具与地层的简化响应。","effect":"成对数据 → 增益 g 与偏置 b","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"03 · 逐步预测并决策","role":"决策","do":"搜索 [-1,1] 的动作，使下一步偏差平方与动作惩罚之和最小。","effect":"当前状态 + 目标 → 候选预测 → 最优动作","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"04 · 模拟执行与再规划","role":"验收","do":"在独立扰动下执行一步，更新状态后重新计算，比较不纠偏基线。","effect":"执行 → 新状态 → 下一次预测","trap":"只模拟一维横向状态，不是三维轨迹控制；无真实工具面或狗腿约束，不能用于现场。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与验收口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>01 构造动作响应样本</b><p>动作 u → 位移增量 Δx</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>02 辨识响应增益</b><p>成对数据 → 增益 g 与偏置 b</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>03 逐步预测并决策</b><p>当前状态 + 目标 → 候选预测 → 最优动作</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>04 模拟执行与再规划</b><p>执行 → 新状态 → 下一次预测</p></div></div><p>指标：横向位移 MAE / m。MAE = 平均绝对误差；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。轨迹误差按横向位移比较；疲劳误差是归一化损伤，不是寿命误差。所有基线与学习模型使用同一测试序列。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"数据泄漏","why":"相邻采样混入训练和测试会虚高结果，现场需要按井或时间块隔离。"},{"name":"工况迁移","why":"岩性、设备、钻井液配方或控制响应变化后必须重新验证。"},{"name":"模型范围","why":"只模拟一维横向状态，不是三维轨迹控制；无真实工具面或狗腿约束，不能用于现场。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2820,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>井眼轨迹智能控制</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>井眼轨迹智能控制</h1><p class=\"lead\">定向钻井通过调整工具响应，使井眼接近目标轨迹。实际轨迹涉及井斜、方位、测深与狗腿度；本例把它简化为沿进尺推进的横向位移，解释预测控制的基本思想。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>目标横向位移 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"目标横向位移\" type=\"range\" min=\"5\" max=\"30\" value=\"20\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 扰动 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：设计/真值；绿：学习/受控；灰：传统基线；各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>目标、受控轨迹与不纠偏基线</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"目标、受控轨迹与不纠偏基线\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>每一步的归一化纠偏动作</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"每一步的归一化纠偏动作\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>线性系统辨识 + 一步预测控制；400条独立训练样本，换井不改变训练参数。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">只模拟一维横向状态，不是三维轨迹控制；无真实工具面或狗腿约束，不能用于现场。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13248,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"trajectory\",SPEC={\"unit\":\" m\",\"value\":20,\"inspect\":\"每步推进10 m，仅模拟一维横向状态。该行同时显示设计、受控、不纠偏基线和下一步动作；末行没有后续动作，留空。不是三维井眼设计。\"};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x));\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nlet seed=91,rows=[],header=[],frame=0;\nconst training=(()=>{let r=rng(17),data=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let a=r(),b=r(),c=r();let x,y;if(TYPE==='rop'){x=[1,a,b,c,a*b,a*a];y=8+30*a+20*b-12*c+8*a*b-13*a*a}else if(TYPE==='trajectory'){x=[1,a*2-1];y=.7*x[1]+.04}else if(TYPE==='fatigue'){x=[1,a,b,a*a];y=.002+.009*a+.003*b+.012*a*a}else {x=[1,a,b,c];y=24+20*a-9*b+12*c}data.push({x,y:y+(r()-.5)*(TYPE==='trajectory'?.03:TYPE==='fatigue'?.001:1)})}return fit(data)})();\nlet rnormal=rng(27),normal=Array.from({length:400},()=>[rnormal(),rnormal(),rnormal()]);\nconst mean=[0,1,2].map(j=>normal.reduce((s,x)=>s+x[j],0)/normal.length),sd=[0,1,2].map(j=>Math.sqrt(normal.reduce((s,x)=>s+(x[j]-mean[j])**2,0)/normal.length));\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max<1?2:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>`<div><span>${a}</span><strong>${b}</strong></div>`).join('')}\nfunction run(){let param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;rows=[];\n if(TYPE==='rop'){let a=param/180,b=.55,c=.25+(seed%17)/50,truth=[],pred=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<90;i++){let rock=clamp(c+.3*Math.sin(i/15),0,1),actual=8+30*a+20*b-12*rock+8*a*b-13*a*a;truth.push(actual);pred.push(predict(training,[1,a,b,clamp(rock+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),a*b,a*a]));base.push(30)}let best={score:-1};let landscape=[];for(let wob=40;wob<=180;wob+=2){let aw=wob/180,rate=predict(training,[1,aw,b,c,aw*b,aw*aw]),torque=4+.065*wob+.02*120,safe=torque<=16;landscape.push(rate);if(safe&&rate>best.score)best={score:rate,wob,torque}}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'}],0,65,'测试井段序号','机械钻速 / m·h⁻¹');chart('b',[{values:landscape,color:'#267e65'}],0,65,'候选序号（钻压 40 + 序号 × 2 kN）','预测钻速 / m·h⁻¹');metrics([['学习 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(2)+' m/h'],['固定基线 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(2)+' m/h'],['受约束推荐钻压',best.wob+' kN'],['推荐点预测扭矩',best.torque.toFixed(2)+' kN·m']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归学习钻压、转速、岩性与钻速的非线性特征映射。当前钻压影响左图；右图遍历候选钻压，按演示扭矩模型排除超过 16 kN·m 的点后选取最高预测钻速。转速固定 120 rpm。左图橙：真值；绿：学习；灰：固定 30 m/h。';header=['segment','truth_m_h','prediction_m_h','baseline_m_h'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='warning'){let scores=[],truth=[],pred=[],base=[],flow=[];for(let t=0;t<120;t++){let event=t>=65&&t<100,level=event?(t-65)/35:0,x=[r(),r(),r()];x[0]+=.8*level;x[1]-=.9*level;x[2]+=.7*level;x=x.map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*noise);let z=x.map((v,j)=>(v-mean[j])/sd[j]),s=Math.sqrt(z.reduce((sum,v)=>sum+v*v,0)/3);scores.push(s);truth.push(event?1:0);pred.push(s>param/10?1:0);base.push(x[0]>1.25?1:0);flow.push(x[1])}let counts=a=>{let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),fp,fn}};let out=counts(pred);chart('a',[{values:scores,color:'#267e65'},{values:scores.map(()=>param/10),color:'#c78c3c'}],0,4,'采样时刻 / min','标准化多变量异常分数',[{start:65,end:99,color:'#faebd4'}]);chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred.map(v=>v*.8),color:'#267e65'},{values:base.map(v=>v*.6),color:'#8c9690'}],0,1.2,'采样时刻 / min','事件与报警（分层显示）');metrics([['多变量 F1',(out.f*100).toFixed(1)+'%'],['单通道基线 F1',(counts(base).f*100).toFixed(1)+'%'],['误报 / 漏报',out.fp+' / '+out.fn],['阈值',(param/10).toFixed(1)]]);$('explain').textContent='400 条正常样本学习各通道均值与标准差，综合扭矩、返出流量、立压的标准化偏离。浅橙区为合成前兆区间，不是已确认事故。阈值降低会提高敏感度，也可能增加误报。右图橙为真值（1），绿为多变量报警（0.8），灰为单通道基线（0.6）。分数不是事故概率。';header=['minute','anomaly_score','truth','alarm','single_channel_alarm'];rows=scores.map((v,i)=>[i,v,truth[i],pred[i],base[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='trajectory'){let target=Array.from({length:61},(_,i)=>param*Math.sin(i/60*Math.PI/2)),actual=[0],baseline=[0],actions=[];for(let i=0;i<60;i++){let best={loss:Infinity,u:0};for(let u=-1;u<=1.001;u+=.05){let next=actual[i]+predict(training,[1,u]);let loss=(next-target[i+1])**2+.15*u*u;if(loss<best.loss)best={loss,u}}actions.push(best.u);let disturb=(r()-.5)*noise*.5;actual.push(actual[i]+.7*best.u+.04+disturb);baseline.push(baseline[i]+.04+disturb)}chart('a',[{values:target,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:actual,color:'#267e65'},{values:baseline,color:'#8c9690'}],-5,35,'进尺步（每步 10 m）','二维示意横向位移 / m');chart('b',[{values:actions,color:'#267e65'}],-1.2,1.2,'控制步（每步 10 m）','归一化纠偏动作 u');metrics([['闭环轨迹 MAE',mae(actual,target).toFixed(2)+' m'],['不纠偏基线 MAE',mae(baseline,target).toFixed(2)+' m'],['学得动作增益',training[1].toFixed(3)],['终点偏差',Math.abs(actual[60]-target[60]).toFixed(2)+' m']]);$('explain').textContent='400 条动作—位移样本辨识响应增益。每推进一步，用学习模型预测各候选动作的下一步位移，最小化偏差平方与动作惩罚，再在独立扰动下模拟执行。橙：设计；绿：闭环；灰：不纠偏。这是一维横向状态的教学控制器，不是完整三维井眼或工具面模型。';header=['step_10m','target_m','controlled_m','baseline_m','action'];rows=target.map((v,i)=>[i,v,actual[i],baseline[i],actions[i]??'']);}\n if(TYPE==='fatigue'){let a=param/100,b=.45,D=0,P=0,B=0,truth=[],pred=[],base=[],rul=[];for(let t=0;t<90;t++){let v=clamp(a+.12*Math.sin((t+seed%31)/10),0,1),damage=.002+.009*v+.003*b+.012*v*v,observed=clamp(v+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),est=Math.max(.0001,predict(training,[1,observed,b,observed*observed]));D+=damage;P+=est;B+=.012;truth.push(D);pred.push(P);base.push(B);rul.push(Math.max(0,(1-P)/est))}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'},{values:truth.map(()=>1),color:'#bb5d52'}],0,2.5,'服役时间 / h','归一化累积损伤 D');chart('b',[{values:rul,color:'#267e65'}],0,500,'服役时间 / h','按当前损伤率外推 RUL / h');metrics([['损伤预测 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(3)],['固定损伤率 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(3)],['末时刻预测损伤',P.toFixed(3)],['末时刻外推寿命',rul.at(-1).toFixed(1)+' h']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归学习振动与扭矩特征到单位时间损伤增量的映射，再逐小时累加；RUL = max(0,(1-D)/当前损伤率)。橙：合成真值；绿：预测；灰：固定损伤率；红：教学失效阈值 D=1。真实疲劳需要载荷谱、材料 S-N 曲线与探伤验证，不能把示意 RUL 当作起钻依据。';header=['hour','damage_truth','damage_predicted','fixed_rate_damage','rul_h'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],rul[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='mud'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],doses=[];for(let t=0;t<90;t++){let a=.4+.2*Math.sin((t+seed%31)/14),temp=.35+.25*t/90,c=param/100,y=24+20*a-9*temp+12*c,p=predict(training,[1,clamp(a+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),temp,c]);truth.push(y);pred.push(p);base.push(35);let dose=0,loss=Infinity;for(let d=-1;d<=1.001;d+=.02){let after=p+8*d,val=(after-38)**2+2*d*d;if(val<loss){loss=val;dose=d}}doses.push(dose)}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'},{values:truth.map(()=>38),color:'#ab6654'}],15,60,'循环采样时刻（每步 5 min）','塑性黏度 PV / mPa·s');chart('b',[{values:doses,color:'#267e65'}],-1.2,1.2,'循环采样时刻（每步 5 min）','归一化处理建议（负值为减黏方向）');metrics([['软测量 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(2)+' mPa·s'],['固定基线 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(2)+' mPa·s'],['目标塑性黏度','38 mPa·s'],['末点处理方向',doses.at(-1)>0?'增黏':'减黏']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归从循环压力代理特征、归一化温度、含砂特征估算塑性黏度，再搜索处理方向以接近目标并惩罚过大调整。橙：真值；绿：估计；灰：固定 35；红：目标 38。动作图是无量纲建议，没有换算现场药剂剂量；未模拟处理后的闭环效果。';header=['sample_5min','pv_truth_mPas','pv_predicted_mPas','baseline_mPas','normalized_action'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],doses[i]]);}\n $('details').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr>'+header.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr></thead><tbody>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>';\n}\nfunction labels(){$('pv').value=$('param').value+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2)}\nfunction schedule(){labels();if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}\nfor(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}\n$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let b=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+header.join(',')+'\\n'+rows.map(r=>r.join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(b),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='drilling-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=25;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='warning'?'正常参考均值：'+mean.map(v=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' / ')+'；标准差：'+sd.map(v=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' / '):'实际学习系数：'+training.map(v=>v.toFixed(5)).join(' / ')};\nfunction inspect(){selected=clamp(selected,0,rows.length-1);$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=header.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let warning=TYPE==='warning',a=rows.map(r=>warning?+(r[2]!==r[3]):r[2]-r[1]),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs));$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+(warning?'逐时刻报警错误（1 为判错）':'学习结果 − 合成真值（正负偏差）')+'；幅度上限 '+max.toFixed(3)+'</text><path d=\"M35 80H685\" stroke=\"#d8d4ca\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?80-v/max*50:80)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-1)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.4,Math.abs(v)/max*50)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#b26a39':'#41699b')+'\"/>').join('')+'<text x=\"35\" y=\"155\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"10\">与主图相同的采样序号 →；柱形数值来自本次计算结果</text>';}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(clamp((x-55)/560,0,1)*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=25;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"drilling-fatigue-v22","sceneId":"d4","title":"钻具失效预测：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"钻具承受交变弯曲和扭转载荷，反复循环可能累积疲劳损伤。累计服役时间相同的钻具，在高振动和低振动下消耗的寿命并不相同。","judge":[{"label":"智能方法","value":"损伤率回归 + 累积损伤外推","desc":"原生 JavaScript 实际计算"},{"label":"数据来源","value":"教学合成","desc":"训练与测试独立随机种子"},{"label":"评估","value":"损伤 MAE 与 RUL / h","desc":"同一测试序列与基线比较"},{"label":"边界","value":"演示","desc":"损伤阈值与生成式均为教学假设，不含真实材料 S-N 曲线、裂纹扩展与载荷谱。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与业务问题","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 740 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"钻具失效预测概念示意\"><rect width=\"740\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><g fill=\"#345648\" font-size=\"17\"><path d=\"M25 145L80 135L135 110L190 85L245 40\" stroke=\"#3f7d64\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M20 35H300\" stroke=\"#b45d4d\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"55\">交变载荷 → 损伤累积</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"100\">D 接近阈值 → 剩余裕度减小</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"145\">未来工况假设决定寿命外推</text></g></svg><p>概念示意，非工程结构图，不按比例绘制。</p><p>钻具承受交变弯曲和扭转载荷，反复循环可能累积疲劳损伤。累计服役时间相同的钻具，在高振动和低振动下消耗的寿命并不相同。</p><p>只按固定小时数估计寿命，不能反映不同载荷强度的差异。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"LEARNING","title":"智能化介入点","html":"<p>方法：损伤率回归 + 累积损伤外推。输入：振动、扭矩代理特征与单位时间损伤增量标签。输出：累积损伤与当前损伤率下的剩余寿命 RUL。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>01 整理载荷与检查记录</b><p>服役历史 + 检查 → 损伤率样本</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>02 学习单位时间损伤</b><p>特征向量 → 预测损伤率</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>03 累计与外推</b><p>损伤率 → D(t) → max(0,(1−D)/损伤率)</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>04 对照与复核</b><p>累积曲线 + 阈值线 → 风险解释</p></div></div><p>回归案例从 400 条训练样本拟合系数，预警案例从 400 条正常样本学习均值与标准差；测试真值仅用于评价，不进入预测函数。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据条件与验证","html":"<p>现场需要：振动、扭矩代理特征与单位时间损伤增量标签；先从少量井建立概念验证，再按独立井、钻具或连续时间块留出验收，不能随机混合相邻采样点。</p><p>演示训练种子固定 17，正常基线种子 27，测试种子初始 91。第二滑块调节观测噪声或状态扰动；更换样本会更换测试种子，训练模型保持固定。</p><p>所用归一化输入在 0–1 范围内，演示的参数区间与数据规模不是现场推荐标准。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"适用边界与参考","html":"<p>损伤阈值与生成式均为教学假设，不含真实材料 S-N 曲线、裂纹扩展与载荷谱。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-directional-drilling\">SLB：定向钻井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-drilling-fluids\">SLB：钻井液概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">官方线性模型原理</a>。这些资料用于概念与方法参考；本项目合成公式与演示代码为独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"钻具失效预测的四步实验","lead":["每一步的输入输出见下图。进入案例演示，可调节参数并导出实际计算结果。"],"stats":[["训练样本","400"],["计算","浏览器"],["验证","独立测试"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 · 整理载荷与检查记录","role":"数据","do":"按钻具编号对齐服役工况与探伤记录，按钻具留出验证。","effect":"服役历史 + 检查 → 损伤率样本","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"02 · 学习单位时间损伤","role":"学习","do":"用振动、扭矩与振动平方拟合小时损伤增量。","effect":"特征向量 → 预测损伤率","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"03 · 累计与外推","role":"决策","do":"逐时累加损伤，再用剩余损伤裕度除以当前损伤率估计 RUL。","effect":"损伤率 → D(t) → max(0,(1−D)/损伤率)","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"04 · 对照与复核","role":"验收","do":"比较固定损伤率基线，观察阈值接近时的寿命变化并识别假设。","effect":"累积曲线 + 阈值线 → 风险解释","trap":"损伤阈值与生成式均为教学假设，不含真实材料 S-N 曲线、裂纹扩展与载荷谱。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与验收口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>01 整理载荷与检查记录</b><p>服役历史 + 检查 → 损伤率样本</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>02 学习单位时间损伤</b><p>特征向量 → 预测损伤率</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>03 累计与外推</b><p>损伤率 → D(t) → max(0,(1−D)/损伤率)</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>04 对照与复核</b><p>累积曲线 + 阈值线 → 风险解释</p></div></div><p>指标：损伤 MAE 与 RUL / h。MAE = 平均绝对误差；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。轨迹误差按横向位移比较；疲劳误差是归一化损伤，不是寿命误差。所有基线与学习模型使用同一测试序列。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"数据泄漏","why":"相邻采样混入训练和测试会虚高结果，现场需要按井或时间块隔离。"},{"name":"工况迁移","why":"岩性、设备、钻井液配方或控制响应变化后必须重新验证。"},{"name":"模型范围","why":"损伤阈值与生成式均为教学假设，不含真实材料 S-N 曲线、裂纹扩展与载荷谱。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2802,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>钻具失效预测</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>钻具失效预测</h1><p class=\"lead\">钻具承受交变弯曲和扭转载荷，反复循环可能累积疲劳损伤。累计服役时间相同的钻具，在高振动和低振动下消耗的寿命并不相同。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>归一化振动水平 ×100 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"归一化振动水平 ×100\" type=\"range\" min=\"10\" max=\"90\" value=\"50\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 扰动 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：设计/真值；绿：学习/受控；灰：传统基线；各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>累积损伤：真值、预测、基线和阈值</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"累积损伤：真值、预测、基线和阈值\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>按当前损伤率外推的剩余寿命</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"按当前损伤率外推的剩余寿命\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>损伤率回归 + 累积损伤外推；400条独立训练样本，换井不改变训练参数。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">损伤阈值与生成式均为教学假设，不含真实材料 S-N 曲线、裂纹扩展与载荷谱。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13230,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"fatigue\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":50,\"inspect\":\"时间单位 h，损伤为归一化数值，阈值1为教学设定。RUL按当前损伤率保持不变的假设外推，不是经材料试验验证的实际剩余寿命。\"};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x));\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nlet seed=91,rows=[],header=[],frame=0;\nconst training=(()=>{let r=rng(17),data=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let a=r(),b=r(),c=r();let x,y;if(TYPE==='rop'){x=[1,a,b,c,a*b,a*a];y=8+30*a+20*b-12*c+8*a*b-13*a*a}else if(TYPE==='trajectory'){x=[1,a*2-1];y=.7*x[1]+.04}else if(TYPE==='fatigue'){x=[1,a,b,a*a];y=.002+.009*a+.003*b+.012*a*a}else {x=[1,a,b,c];y=24+20*a-9*b+12*c}data.push({x,y:y+(r()-.5)*(TYPE==='trajectory'?.03:TYPE==='fatigue'?.001:1)})}return fit(data)})();\nlet rnormal=rng(27),normal=Array.from({length:400},()=>[rnormal(),rnormal(),rnormal()]);\nconst mean=[0,1,2].map(j=>normal.reduce((s,x)=>s+x[j],0)/normal.length),sd=[0,1,2].map(j=>Math.sqrt(normal.reduce((s,x)=>s+(x[j]-mean[j])**2,0)/normal.length));\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max<1?2:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>`<div><span>${a}</span><strong>${b}</strong></div>`).join('')}\nfunction run(){let param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;rows=[];\n if(TYPE==='rop'){let a=param/180,b=.55,c=.25+(seed%17)/50,truth=[],pred=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<90;i++){let rock=clamp(c+.3*Math.sin(i/15),0,1),actual=8+30*a+20*b-12*rock+8*a*b-13*a*a;truth.push(actual);pred.push(predict(training,[1,a,b,clamp(rock+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),a*b,a*a]));base.push(30)}let best={score:-1};let landscape=[];for(let wob=40;wob<=180;wob+=2){let aw=wob/180,rate=predict(training,[1,aw,b,c,aw*b,aw*aw]),torque=4+.065*wob+.02*120,safe=torque<=16;landscape.push(rate);if(safe&&rate>best.score)best={score:rate,wob,torque}}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'}],0,65,'测试井段序号','机械钻速 / m·h⁻¹');chart('b',[{values:landscape,color:'#267e65'}],0,65,'候选序号（钻压 40 + 序号 × 2 kN）','预测钻速 / m·h⁻¹');metrics([['学习 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(2)+' m/h'],['固定基线 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(2)+' m/h'],['受约束推荐钻压',best.wob+' kN'],['推荐点预测扭矩',best.torque.toFixed(2)+' kN·m']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归学习钻压、转速、岩性与钻速的非线性特征映射。当前钻压影响左图；右图遍历候选钻压，按演示扭矩模型排除超过 16 kN·m 的点后选取最高预测钻速。转速固定 120 rpm。左图橙：真值；绿：学习；灰：固定 30 m/h。';header=['segment','truth_m_h','prediction_m_h','baseline_m_h'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='warning'){let scores=[],truth=[],pred=[],base=[],flow=[];for(let t=0;t<120;t++){let event=t>=65&&t<100,level=event?(t-65)/35:0,x=[r(),r(),r()];x[0]+=.8*level;x[1]-=.9*level;x[2]+=.7*level;x=x.map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*noise);let z=x.map((v,j)=>(v-mean[j])/sd[j]),s=Math.sqrt(z.reduce((sum,v)=>sum+v*v,0)/3);scores.push(s);truth.push(event?1:0);pred.push(s>param/10?1:0);base.push(x[0]>1.25?1:0);flow.push(x[1])}let counts=a=>{let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),fp,fn}};let out=counts(pred);chart('a',[{values:scores,color:'#267e65'},{values:scores.map(()=>param/10),color:'#c78c3c'}],0,4,'采样时刻 / min','标准化多变量异常分数',[{start:65,end:99,color:'#faebd4'}]);chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred.map(v=>v*.8),color:'#267e65'},{values:base.map(v=>v*.6),color:'#8c9690'}],0,1.2,'采样时刻 / min','事件与报警（分层显示）');metrics([['多变量 F1',(out.f*100).toFixed(1)+'%'],['单通道基线 F1',(counts(base).f*100).toFixed(1)+'%'],['误报 / 漏报',out.fp+' / '+out.fn],['阈值',(param/10).toFixed(1)]]);$('explain').textContent='400 条正常样本学习各通道均值与标准差，综合扭矩、返出流量、立压的标准化偏离。浅橙区为合成前兆区间，不是已确认事故。阈值降低会提高敏感度，也可能增加误报。右图橙为真值（1），绿为多变量报警（0.8），灰为单通道基线（0.6）。分数不是事故概率。';header=['minute','anomaly_score','truth','alarm','single_channel_alarm'];rows=scores.map((v,i)=>[i,v,truth[i],pred[i],base[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='trajectory'){let target=Array.from({length:61},(_,i)=>param*Math.sin(i/60*Math.PI/2)),actual=[0],baseline=[0],actions=[];for(let i=0;i<60;i++){let best={loss:Infinity,u:0};for(let u=-1;u<=1.001;u+=.05){let next=actual[i]+predict(training,[1,u]);let loss=(next-target[i+1])**2+.15*u*u;if(loss<best.loss)best={loss,u}}actions.push(best.u);let disturb=(r()-.5)*noise*.5;actual.push(actual[i]+.7*best.u+.04+disturb);baseline.push(baseline[i]+.04+disturb)}chart('a',[{values:target,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:actual,color:'#267e65'},{values:baseline,color:'#8c9690'}],-5,35,'进尺步（每步 10 m）','二维示意横向位移 / m');chart('b',[{values:actions,color:'#267e65'}],-1.2,1.2,'控制步（每步 10 m）','归一化纠偏动作 u');metrics([['闭环轨迹 MAE',mae(actual,target).toFixed(2)+' m'],['不纠偏基线 MAE',mae(baseline,target).toFixed(2)+' m'],['学得动作增益',training[1].toFixed(3)],['终点偏差',Math.abs(actual[60]-target[60]).toFixed(2)+' m']]);$('explain').textContent='400 条动作—位移样本辨识响应增益。每推进一步，用学习模型预测各候选动作的下一步位移，最小化偏差平方与动作惩罚，再在独立扰动下模拟执行。橙：设计；绿：闭环；灰：不纠偏。这是一维横向状态的教学控制器，不是完整三维井眼或工具面模型。';header=['step_10m','target_m','controlled_m','baseline_m','action'];rows=target.map((v,i)=>[i,v,actual[i],baseline[i],actions[i]??'']);}\n if(TYPE==='fatigue'){let a=param/100,b=.45,D=0,P=0,B=0,truth=[],pred=[],base=[],rul=[];for(let t=0;t<90;t++){let v=clamp(a+.12*Math.sin((t+seed%31)/10),0,1),damage=.002+.009*v+.003*b+.012*v*v,observed=clamp(v+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),est=Math.max(.0001,predict(training,[1,observed,b,observed*observed]));D+=damage;P+=est;B+=.012;truth.push(D);pred.push(P);base.push(B);rul.push(Math.max(0,(1-P)/est))}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'},{values:truth.map(()=>1),color:'#bb5d52'}],0,2.5,'服役时间 / h','归一化累积损伤 D');chart('b',[{values:rul,color:'#267e65'}],0,500,'服役时间 / h','按当前损伤率外推 RUL / h');metrics([['损伤预测 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(3)],['固定损伤率 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(3)],['末时刻预测损伤',P.toFixed(3)],['末时刻外推寿命',rul.at(-1).toFixed(1)+' h']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归学习振动与扭矩特征到单位时间损伤增量的映射，再逐小时累加；RUL = max(0,(1-D)/当前损伤率)。橙：合成真值；绿：预测；灰：固定损伤率；红：教学失效阈值 D=1。真实疲劳需要载荷谱、材料 S-N 曲线与探伤验证，不能把示意 RUL 当作起钻依据。';header=['hour','damage_truth','damage_predicted','fixed_rate_damage','rul_h'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],rul[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='mud'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],doses=[];for(let t=0;t<90;t++){let a=.4+.2*Math.sin((t+seed%31)/14),temp=.35+.25*t/90,c=param/100,y=24+20*a-9*temp+12*c,p=predict(training,[1,clamp(a+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),temp,c]);truth.push(y);pred.push(p);base.push(35);let dose=0,loss=Infinity;for(let d=-1;d<=1.001;d+=.02){let after=p+8*d,val=(after-38)**2+2*d*d;if(val<loss){loss=val;dose=d}}doses.push(dose)}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'},{values:truth.map(()=>38),color:'#ab6654'}],15,60,'循环采样时刻（每步 5 min）','塑性黏度 PV / mPa·s');chart('b',[{values:doses,color:'#267e65'}],-1.2,1.2,'循环采样时刻（每步 5 min）','归一化处理建议（负值为减黏方向）');metrics([['软测量 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(2)+' mPa·s'],['固定基线 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(2)+' mPa·s'],['目标塑性黏度','38 mPa·s'],['末点处理方向',doses.at(-1)>0?'增黏':'减黏']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归从循环压力代理特征、归一化温度、含砂特征估算塑性黏度，再搜索处理方向以接近目标并惩罚过大调整。橙：真值；绿：估计；灰：固定 35；红：目标 38。动作图是无量纲建议，没有换算现场药剂剂量；未模拟处理后的闭环效果。';header=['sample_5min','pv_truth_mPas','pv_predicted_mPas','baseline_mPas','normalized_action'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],doses[i]]);}\n $('details').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr>'+header.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr></thead><tbody>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>';\n}\nfunction labels(){$('pv').value=$('param').value+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2)}\nfunction schedule(){labels();if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}\nfor(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}\n$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let b=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+header.join(',')+'\\n'+rows.map(r=>r.join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(b),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='drilling-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=25;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='warning'?'正常参考均值：'+mean.map(v=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' / ')+'；标准差：'+sd.map(v=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' / '):'实际学习系数：'+training.map(v=>v.toFixed(5)).join(' / ')};\nfunction inspect(){selected=clamp(selected,0,rows.length-1);$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=header.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let warning=TYPE==='warning',a=rows.map(r=>warning?+(r[2]!==r[3]):r[2]-r[1]),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs));$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+(warning?'逐时刻报警错误（1 为判错）':'学习结果 − 合成真值（正负偏差）')+'；幅度上限 '+max.toFixed(3)+'</text><path d=\"M35 80H685\" stroke=\"#d8d4ca\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?80-v/max*50:80)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-1)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.4,Math.abs(v)/max*50)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#b26a39':'#41699b')+'\"/>').join('')+'<text x=\"35\" y=\"155\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"10\">与主图相同的采样序号 →；柱形数值来自本次计算结果</text>';}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(clamp((x-55)/560,0,1)*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=25;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"drilling-mud-v22","sceneId":"d5","title":"钻井液性能智能调控：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"钻井液承担携岩、冷却润滑与压力控制等任务。塑性黏度是流变参数之一，与固相、流体基液和温度等因素有关；不能把塑性黏度直接等同于携岩能力。","judge":[{"label":"智能方法","value":"岭回归软测量 + 处理方向搜索","desc":"原生 JavaScript 实际计算"},{"label":"数据来源","value":"教学合成","desc":"训练与测试独立随机种子"},{"label":"评估","value":"塑性黏度 MAE / mPa·s","desc":"同一测试序列与基线比较"},{"label":"边界","value":"演示","desc":"仅估算塑性黏度，不同时优化密度、动切力或滤失；建议不对应实际药剂种类和加量。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与业务问题","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 740 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"钻井液性能智能调控概念示意\"><rect width=\"740\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><g fill=\"#345648\" font-size=\"17\"><path d=\"M60 25V145H190V25M125 35V130\" stroke=\"#3f7d64\" stroke-width=\"6\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M90 50V120M165 120V50\" stroke=\"#c38d42\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"55\">钻井液沿钻柱下行、环空返出</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"100\">温度与固相影响流变性质</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"145\">稀疏化验 + 连续工况 → 软测量</text></g></svg><p>概念示意，非工程结构图，不按比例绘制。</p><p>钻井液承担携岩、冷却润滑与压力控制等任务。塑性黏度是流变参数之一，与固相、流体基液和温度等因素有关；不能把塑性黏度直接等同于携岩能力。</p><p>实验室流变测试较稀疏，循环状态却持续变化，人工处理可能滞后。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"LEARNING","title":"智能化介入点","html":"<p>方法：岭回归软测量 + 处理方向搜索。输入：归一化循环压力代理、温度、含砂特征与塑性黏度标签。输出：实时黏度估计与无量纲增黏/减黏建议。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>01 多源时间对齐</b><p>高频工况 + 稀疏标签 → 监督样本</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>02 训练软测量模型</b><p>工况向量 → 估计 PV</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>03 搜索处理方向</b><p>PV 估计 + 目标 38 → 处理方向</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>04 观察与复核</b><p>黏度曲线 + 方向曲线 → 复核</p></div></div><p>回归案例从 400 条训练样本拟合系数，预警案例从 400 条正常样本学习均值与标准差；测试真值仅用于评价，不进入预测函数。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据条件与验证","html":"<p>现场需要：归一化循环压力代理、温度、含砂特征与塑性黏度标签；先从少量井建立概念验证，再按独立井、钻具或连续时间块留出验收，不能随机混合相邻采样点。</p><p>演示训练种子固定 17，正常基线种子 27，测试种子初始 91。第二滑块调节观测噪声或状态扰动；更换样本会更换测试种子，训练模型保持固定。</p><p>所用归一化输入在 0–1 范围内，演示的参数区间与数据规模不是现场推荐标准。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"适用边界与参考","html":"<p>仅估算塑性黏度，不同时优化密度、动切力或滤失；建议不对应实际药剂种类和加量。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-directional-drilling\">SLB：定向钻井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-drilling-fluids\">SLB：钻井液概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">官方线性模型原理</a>。这些资料用于概念与方法参考；本项目合成公式与演示代码为独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"钻井液性能智能调控的四步实验","lead":["每一步的输入输出见下图。进入案例演示，可调节参数并导出实际计算结果。"],"stats":[["训练样本","400"],["计算","浏览器"],["验证","独立测试"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 · 多源时间对齐","role":"数据","do":"将循环压力、温度和含砂特征对齐到稀疏流变测试时刻。","effect":"高频工况 + 稀疏标签 → 监督样本","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"02 · 训练软测量模型","role":"学习","do":"拟合实时特征到塑性黏度的回归映射，按井或时段验证。","effect":"工况向量 → 估计 PV","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"03 · 搜索处理方向","role":"决策","do":"扫描归一化动作，平衡目标黏度偏差与调整幅度惩罚。","effect":"PV 估计 + 目标 38 → 处理方向","trap":"真实资料需按井或时间隔离，检查单位、工况与分布漂移。"},{"name":"04 · 观察与复核","role":"验收","do":"查看估计误差与建议序列；实际处理仍需试验和工程师审核。","effect":"黏度曲线 + 方向曲线 → 复核","trap":"仅估算塑性黏度，不同时优化密度、动切力或滤失；建议不对应实际药剂种类和加量。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与验收口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>01 多源时间对齐</b><p>高频工况 + 稀疏标签 → 监督样本</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>02 训练软测量模型</b><p>工况向量 → 估计 PV</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>03 搜索处理方向</b><p>PV 估计 + 目标 38 → 处理方向</p></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:140px;background:#e8f1e7;padding:12px;border-radius:9px\"><b>04 观察与复核</b><p>黏度曲线 + 方向曲线 → 复核</p></div></div><p>指标：塑性黏度 MAE / mPa·s。MAE = 平均绝对误差；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。轨迹误差按横向位移比较；疲劳误差是归一化损伤，不是寿命误差。所有基线与学习模型使用同一测试序列。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"数据泄漏","why":"相邻采样混入训练和测试会虚高结果，现场需要按井或时间块隔离。"},{"name":"工况迁移","why":"岩性、设备、钻井液配方或控制响应变化后必须重新验证。"},{"name":"模型范围","why":"仅估算塑性黏度，不同时优化密度、动切力或滤失；建议不对应实际药剂种类和加量。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2852,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>钻井液性能智能调控</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>钻井液性能智能调控</h1><p class=\"lead\">钻井液承担携岩、冷却润滑与压力控制等任务。塑性黏度是流变参数之一，与固相、流体基液和温度等因素有关；不能把塑性黏度直接等同于携岩能力。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>归一化含砂特征 ×100 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"归一化含砂特征 ×100\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"40\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 扰动 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：设计/真值；绿：学习/受控；灰：传统基线；各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>PV真值、估计、固定基线与目标</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"PV真值、估计、固定基线与目标\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>归一化处理方向，不是药剂剂量</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"归一化处理方向，不是药剂剂量\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>岭回归软测量 + 处理方向搜索；400条独立训练样本，换井不改变训练参数。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">仅估算塑性黏度，不同时优化密度、动切力或滤失；建议不对应实际药剂种类和加量。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13179,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"mud\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":40,\"inspect\":\"每步5 min，PV单位mPa·s。动作是归一化处理方向，未换算药剂量，也未模拟施加后的闭环结果。\"};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x));\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nlet seed=91,rows=[],header=[],frame=0;\nconst training=(()=>{let r=rng(17),data=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let a=r(),b=r(),c=r();let x,y;if(TYPE==='rop'){x=[1,a,b,c,a*b,a*a];y=8+30*a+20*b-12*c+8*a*b-13*a*a}else if(TYPE==='trajectory'){x=[1,a*2-1];y=.7*x[1]+.04}else if(TYPE==='fatigue'){x=[1,a,b,a*a];y=.002+.009*a+.003*b+.012*a*a}else {x=[1,a,b,c];y=24+20*a-9*b+12*c}data.push({x,y:y+(r()-.5)*(TYPE==='trajectory'?.03:TYPE==='fatigue'?.001:1)})}return fit(data)})();\nlet rnormal=rng(27),normal=Array.from({length:400},()=>[rnormal(),rnormal(),rnormal()]);\nconst mean=[0,1,2].map(j=>normal.reduce((s,x)=>s+x[j],0)/normal.length),sd=[0,1,2].map(j=>Math.sqrt(normal.reduce((s,x)=>s+(x[j]-mean[j])**2,0)/normal.length));\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max<1?2:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>`<div><span>${a}</span><strong>${b}</strong></div>`).join('')}\nfunction run(){let param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;rows=[];\n if(TYPE==='rop'){let a=param/180,b=.55,c=.25+(seed%17)/50,truth=[],pred=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<90;i++){let rock=clamp(c+.3*Math.sin(i/15),0,1),actual=8+30*a+20*b-12*rock+8*a*b-13*a*a;truth.push(actual);pred.push(predict(training,[1,a,b,clamp(rock+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),a*b,a*a]));base.push(30)}let best={score:-1};let landscape=[];for(let wob=40;wob<=180;wob+=2){let aw=wob/180,rate=predict(training,[1,aw,b,c,aw*b,aw*aw]),torque=4+.065*wob+.02*120,safe=torque<=16;landscape.push(rate);if(safe&&rate>best.score)best={score:rate,wob,torque}}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'}],0,65,'测试井段序号','机械钻速 / m·h⁻¹');chart('b',[{values:landscape,color:'#267e65'}],0,65,'候选序号（钻压 40 + 序号 × 2 kN）','预测钻速 / m·h⁻¹');metrics([['学习 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(2)+' m/h'],['固定基线 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(2)+' m/h'],['受约束推荐钻压',best.wob+' kN'],['推荐点预测扭矩',best.torque.toFixed(2)+' kN·m']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归学习钻压、转速、岩性与钻速的非线性特征映射。当前钻压影响左图；右图遍历候选钻压，按演示扭矩模型排除超过 16 kN·m 的点后选取最高预测钻速。转速固定 120 rpm。左图橙：真值；绿：学习；灰：固定 30 m/h。';header=['segment','truth_m_h','prediction_m_h','baseline_m_h'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='warning'){let scores=[],truth=[],pred=[],base=[],flow=[];for(let t=0;t<120;t++){let event=t>=65&&t<100,level=event?(t-65)/35:0,x=[r(),r(),r()];x[0]+=.8*level;x[1]-=.9*level;x[2]+=.7*level;x=x.map(v=>v+(r()-.5)*noise);let z=x.map((v,j)=>(v-mean[j])/sd[j]),s=Math.sqrt(z.reduce((sum,v)=>sum+v*v,0)/3);scores.push(s);truth.push(event?1:0);pred.push(s>param/10?1:0);base.push(x[0]>1.25?1:0);flow.push(x[1])}let counts=a=>{let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),fp,fn}};let out=counts(pred);chart('a',[{values:scores,color:'#267e65'},{values:scores.map(()=>param/10),color:'#c78c3c'}],0,4,'采样时刻 / min','标准化多变量异常分数',[{start:65,end:99,color:'#faebd4'}]);chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred.map(v=>v*.8),color:'#267e65'},{values:base.map(v=>v*.6),color:'#8c9690'}],0,1.2,'采样时刻 / min','事件与报警（分层显示）');metrics([['多变量 F1',(out.f*100).toFixed(1)+'%'],['单通道基线 F1',(counts(base).f*100).toFixed(1)+'%'],['误报 / 漏报',out.fp+' / '+out.fn],['阈值',(param/10).toFixed(1)]]);$('explain').textContent='400 条正常样本学习各通道均值与标准差，综合扭矩、返出流量、立压的标准化偏离。浅橙区为合成前兆区间，不是已确认事故。阈值降低会提高敏感度，也可能增加误报。右图橙为真值（1），绿为多变量报警（0.8），灰为单通道基线（0.6）。分数不是事故概率。';header=['minute','anomaly_score','truth','alarm','single_channel_alarm'];rows=scores.map((v,i)=>[i,v,truth[i],pred[i],base[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='trajectory'){let target=Array.from({length:61},(_,i)=>param*Math.sin(i/60*Math.PI/2)),actual=[0],baseline=[0],actions=[];for(let i=0;i<60;i++){let best={loss:Infinity,u:0};for(let u=-1;u<=1.001;u+=.05){let next=actual[i]+predict(training,[1,u]);let loss=(next-target[i+1])**2+.15*u*u;if(loss<best.loss)best={loss,u}}actions.push(best.u);let disturb=(r()-.5)*noise*.5;actual.push(actual[i]+.7*best.u+.04+disturb);baseline.push(baseline[i]+.04+disturb)}chart('a',[{values:target,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:actual,color:'#267e65'},{values:baseline,color:'#8c9690'}],-5,35,'进尺步（每步 10 m）','二维示意横向位移 / m');chart('b',[{values:actions,color:'#267e65'}],-1.2,1.2,'控制步（每步 10 m）','归一化纠偏动作 u');metrics([['闭环轨迹 MAE',mae(actual,target).toFixed(2)+' m'],['不纠偏基线 MAE',mae(baseline,target).toFixed(2)+' m'],['学得动作增益',training[1].toFixed(3)],['终点偏差',Math.abs(actual[60]-target[60]).toFixed(2)+' m']]);$('explain').textContent='400 条动作—位移样本辨识响应增益。每推进一步，用学习模型预测各候选动作的下一步位移，最小化偏差平方与动作惩罚，再在独立扰动下模拟执行。橙：设计；绿：闭环；灰：不纠偏。这是一维横向状态的教学控制器，不是完整三维井眼或工具面模型。';header=['step_10m','target_m','controlled_m','baseline_m','action'];rows=target.map((v,i)=>[i,v,actual[i],baseline[i],actions[i]??'']);}\n if(TYPE==='fatigue'){let a=param/100,b=.45,D=0,P=0,B=0,truth=[],pred=[],base=[],rul=[];for(let t=0;t<90;t++){let v=clamp(a+.12*Math.sin((t+seed%31)/10),0,1),damage=.002+.009*v+.003*b+.012*v*v,observed=clamp(v+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),est=Math.max(.0001,predict(training,[1,observed,b,observed*observed]));D+=damage;P+=est;B+=.012;truth.push(D);pred.push(P);base.push(B);rul.push(Math.max(0,(1-P)/est))}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'},{values:truth.map(()=>1),color:'#bb5d52'}],0,2.5,'服役时间 / h','归一化累积损伤 D');chart('b',[{values:rul,color:'#267e65'}],0,500,'服役时间 / h','按当前损伤率外推 RUL / h');metrics([['损伤预测 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(3)],['固定损伤率 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(3)],['末时刻预测损伤',P.toFixed(3)],['末时刻外推寿命',rul.at(-1).toFixed(1)+' h']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归学习振动与扭矩特征到单位时间损伤增量的映射，再逐小时累加；RUL = max(0,(1-D)/当前损伤率)。橙：合成真值；绿：预测；灰：固定损伤率；红：教学失效阈值 D=1。真实疲劳需要载荷谱、材料 S-N 曲线与探伤验证，不能把示意 RUL 当作起钻依据。';header=['hour','damage_truth','damage_predicted','fixed_rate_damage','rul_h'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],rul[i]]);}\n if(TYPE==='mud'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],doses=[];for(let t=0;t<90;t++){let a=.4+.2*Math.sin((t+seed%31)/14),temp=.35+.25*t/90,c=param/100,y=24+20*a-9*temp+12*c,p=predict(training,[1,clamp(a+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1),temp,c]);truth.push(y);pred.push(p);base.push(35);let dose=0,loss=Infinity;for(let d=-1;d<=1.001;d+=.02){let after=p+8*d,val=(after-38)**2+2*d*d;if(val<loss){loss=val;dose=d}}doses.push(dose)}chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c78c3c'},{values:pred,color:'#267e65'},{values:base,color:'#8c9690'},{values:truth.map(()=>38),color:'#ab6654'}],15,60,'循环采样时刻（每步 5 min）','塑性黏度 PV / mPa·s');chart('b',[{values:doses,color:'#267e65'}],-1.2,1.2,'循环采样时刻（每步 5 min）','归一化处理建议（负值为减黏方向）');metrics([['软测量 MAE',mae(pred,truth).toFixed(2)+' mPa·s'],['固定基线 MAE',mae(base,truth).toFixed(2)+' mPa·s'],['目标塑性黏度','38 mPa·s'],['末点处理方向',doses.at(-1)>0?'增黏':'减黏']]);$('explain').textContent='岭回归从循环压力代理特征、归一化温度、含砂特征估算塑性黏度，再搜索处理方向以接近目标并惩罚过大调整。橙：真值；绿：估计；灰：固定 35；红：目标 38。动作图是无量纲建议，没有换算现场药剂剂量；未模拟处理后的闭环效果。';header=['sample_5min','pv_truth_mPas','pv_predicted_mPas','baseline_mPas','normalized_action'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,pred[i],base[i],doses[i]]);}\n $('details').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr>'+header.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr></thead><tbody>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>';\n}\nfunction labels(){$('pv').value=$('param').value+SPEC.unit;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2)}\nfunction schedule(){labels();if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}\nfor(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}\n$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let b=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+header.join(',')+'\\n'+rows.map(r=>r.join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(b),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='drilling-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=25;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='warning'?'正常参考均值：'+mean.map(v=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' / ')+'；标准差：'+sd.map(v=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' / '):'实际学习系数：'+training.map(v=>v.toFixed(5)).join(' / ')};\nfunction inspect(){selected=clamp(selected,0,rows.length-1);$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=header.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let warning=TYPE==='warning',a=rows.map(r=>warning?+(r[2]!==r[3]):r[2]-r[1]),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs));$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+(warning?'逐时刻报警错误（1 为判错）':'学习结果 − 合成真值（正负偏差）')+'；幅度上限 '+max.toFixed(3)+'</text><path d=\"M35 80H685\" stroke=\"#d8d4ca\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?80-v/max*50:80)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-1)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.4,Math.abs(v)/max*50)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#b26a39':'#41699b')+'\"/>').join('')+'<text x=\"35\" y=\"155\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"10\">与主图相同的采样序号 →；柱形数值来自本次计算结果</text>';}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(clamp((x-55)/560,0,1)*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=25;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}